@startuml
title Activity — data đến model release
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #405670
|Data Engineer|
start
:Audit source/terms/PII;
:Generate ảnh + JSON + box;
:Family split / dedupe / manifest;
|AI-1|
:OCR vi / canonical geometry;
|AI-2|
repeat
:Hardware + model smoke / train step;
|Lead|
if (Feasible?) then (yes)
:Khóa candidate và resource profile;
else (no)
:Chọn smaller candidate / ADR;
endif
repeat while (Cần thử candidate khác?) is (yes) not (no)
|AI-2|
:Baseline / fine-tune bounded cycles;
|Data Engineer|
:Dev eval / calibrate / error report;
|Lead|
:Freeze checkpoint + evaluator;
|Data Engineer|
:Final holdout + independent mock;
|Lead|
if (Quality/correctness pass?) then (yes)
|AI-2|
:Manifest / model card / serving smoke;
|Backend / Lead|
:Controlled activation for NEW jobs\nexisting jobs retain pinned release;
else (no)
|Lead|
:Report failed criteria; new dev/test if iterate;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Không training từ corrections tự động; final holdout không dùng tune; gate bằng metric và deployment smoke.
endlegend
@enduml
